<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="PNvr8D1h4Wbux_D_yYQ1cNb17MP6AJE6r3x7guVR3Bs" />
  {%- if settings.ga_id != blank -%}
  <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id={{ settings.ga_id }}"></script>
  <script>
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
    gtag('js', new Date());
    gtag('config', '{{ settings.ga_id }}');
  </script>
  {%- endif -%}
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noodp,index,follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
  <meta name="description" content="{{ page_description }}">
  {%- comment -%}
    Brand name — single source of truth (settings.skinhealthy_brand_name).
    Hoist lên đây để <title> và logo header (dòng ~547) dùng CHUNG 1 biến,
    tránh lệch pha tên thương hiệu giữa tab trình duyệt và thanh điều hướng.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign sh_brand_name = settings.skinhealthy_brand_name | default: settings.store_name | default: store.name -%}
  <title>{{ page_title }} — {{ sh_brand_name }}</title>
  {%- if settings.skinhealthy_favicon != blank -%}
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ settings.skinhealthy_favicon | img_url: 'icon' }}" type="image/png">
  {%- elsif settings.theme_favicon_enable -%}
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ 'favicon.png' | asset_url }}" type="image/x-icon">
  {%- endif -%}

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  {{- 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap' | stylesheet_tag -}}
  {{- 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800;900&display=swap' | stylesheet_tag -}}
  {{- 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap' | stylesheet_tag -}}
  {{- 'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap' | stylesheet_tag -}}
  {%- comment -%}
    REOPEN 2026-09-10 (ADR-007/T-70): Fraunces/Cormorant Garamond (init data 2026-08) thay bằng
    Playfair Display ở --sh-serif — thống nhất 1 design system với theme.bwt theo xlsx mới
    ("Pharma Cosmetics-20260910T092731Z-1-001/Pharma Cosmetics/*.xlsx", cả 2 file xlsx Portal +
    Clinic dùng chung 1 hệ token/font). Montserrat/Inter/IBM Plex Mono qua Google Fonts css2 tự
    phục vụ subset vietnamese theo unicode-range — không cần khai báo @font-face riêng.
  {%- endcomment -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Tailwind CDN (JIT, không build step) — chỉ dùng cho markup MỚI thêm vào các trang
    con của layout này (vd. section Philosophy/Đội ngũ/FAQ trong page.indexskinhealthy),
    để không phải viết thêm CSS thủ công làm phình source. preflight tắt vì layout đã tự
    reset (`*, *::before, *::after` bên dưới) và có toàn bộ hệ thống class sh-*/sh3-* riêng —
    bật preflight sẽ đè font/margin mặc định của các thẻ h1..h6/button/ul đang dùng chung.
    Quy ước: xem memory project_vue_cdn_convention cho pattern Tailwind CDN tương tự ở mops-admin.
    REOPEN 2026-09-10 (ADR-007/T-70): spa-* đổi giá trị sang palette xlsx mới (đồng bộ với
    layouts/theme.bwt) — spa-dark/dark2/dark3→brand-deep + 2 sắc dark-mode kế cận,
    spa-gold→peach, spa-gold-ink→gold-dark, spa-gold-light→peach-light, spa-white/light→bg-page,
    spa-line→border-clinical, spa-navy→text-main (giá trị #13241F giữ nguyên — đã trùng sẵn).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script id="sh-tailwind-config">
    tailwind.config = {
      corePlugins: { preflight: false },
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            'spa-dark':  '#0F2318',
            'spa-dark2': '#132E20',
            'spa-dark3': '#1B3E2D',
            'spa-gold':  '#D79A7D',
            'spa-gold-ink': '#B8860B',
            'spa-gold-light': '#F6E3D8',
            'spa-white': '#F8FAF7',
            'spa-light': '#F8FAF7',
            'spa-line':  '#E2E8F0',
            'spa-navy':  '#13241F'
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans:  ['Inter', 'Montserrat', 'sans-serif'],
            serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],
            mono:  ['IBM Plex Mono', 'ui-monospace', 'monospace']
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>

  {{ content_for_header }}

  <style>
    :root {
      /* REOPEN 2026-09-10 (ADR-007/T-70): palette xlsx mới — thống nhất 1 hệ thương hiệu
         "SKIN HEALTH BEAUTY by PHARMA COSMETICS" với theme.bwt (2 file xlsx dùng chung 1 design
         system). Tên biến giữ nguyên (--sh-ink, --sh-gold, --sh-ivory...) để CSS layer bên dưới
         KHÔNG phải sửa; chỉ giá trị đổi. --sh-ink/--sh-primary vốn đã trùng token mới
         (text-main #13241F, brand-primary #3cb371) từ lần chỉnh init data 2026-08 trước — giữ
         nguyên, không đổi. */
      --sh-ivory:       {{ settings.skinhealthy_bg_color | default: '#F8FAF7' }};
      --sh-ivory-dark:  #EAEBE5;
      --sh-ink:         {{ settings.skinhealthy_accent_color | default: '#13241F' }};
      --sh-ink-60:      rgba(19,36,31,.6);
      --sh-ink-30:      rgba(19,36,31,.3);
      --sh-gold:        {{ settings.skinhealthy_main_color | default: '#D79A7D' }};   /* peach accent theo xlsx */
      --sh-clay-soft:   #F6E3D8;
      --sh-primary:     #3cb371;   /* brand-primary Pharma Cosmetics — dùng cho CTA/eyebrow */
      --sh-primary-deep:#166B55;
      --sh-white:       #FFFFFF;
      --sh-line:        #E2E8F0;

      /* typography — Playfair Display cho heading editorial (thay Fraunces/Cormorant Garamond),
         Inter cho body/UI, Montserrat còn dùng như secondary label; IBM Plex Mono cho eyebrow. */
      --sh-serif:  'Playfair Display', serif;
      --sh-sans:   'Inter', 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      --sh-mono:   'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;

      /* spacing */
      --sh-container: 1280px;

      /* motion */
      --sh-ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);

      /* inherit project vars */
      --mainColor:   {{ settings.theme_main_color }};
      --subColor:    {{ settings.theme_sub_color }};
      --textColor:   {{ settings.theme_body_text_color }};
      --font-primary: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      --dur-base: 300ms;
      --dur-fast: 150ms;
    }

    {%- comment -%}
      REOPEN 2026-09-10 (ADR-007/T-71): dark theme cho hệ --sh-* — cặp giá trị dark đúng xlsx,
      đồng bộ cơ chế với snippets/pharma_ui_kit.bwt (theme.bwt): @media prefers-color-scheme
      + [data-theme="dark"] toggle thủ công.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
        --sh-ivory:        #0B1712;
        --sh-ivory-dark:   #112A1E;
        --sh-ink:          #F1F5F3;
        --sh-ink-60:       rgba(241,245,243,.6);
        --sh-ink-30:       rgba(241,245,243,.3);
        --sh-gold:         #E8A588;
        --sh-clay-soft:    #2E1D16;
        --sh-primary:      #3ED58C;
        --sh-primary-deep: #2DD4BF;
        --sh-white:        #132E20;
        --sh-line:         #1E3A2B;
      }
    }
    :root[data-theme="dark"] {
      --sh-ivory:        #0B1712;
      --sh-ivory-dark:   #112A1E;
      --sh-ink:          #F1F5F3;
      --sh-ink-60:       rgba(241,245,243,.6);
      --sh-ink-30:       rgba(241,245,243,.3);
      --sh-gold:         #E8A588;
      --sh-clay-soft:    #2E1D16;
      --sh-primary:      #3ED58C;
      --sh-primary-deep: #2DD4BF;
      --sh-white:        #132E20;
      --sh-line:         #1E3A2B;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

    body.layout-skinhealthy {
      background: var(--sh-ivory);
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: var(--fs-base);
    }

    .sh-container {
      max-width: var(--sh-container);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 40px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .sh-container { padding: 0 20px; }
    }

    /* ── SERVICE BASKET BAR ─────────────────────────────── */
    .sh-cart-bar {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 120;
      background: var(--sh-ink);
      transform: translateY(100%);
      transition: transform 320ms var(--sh-ease);
    }
    .sh-cart-bar.is-open { transform: translateY(0); }
    .sh-cart-bar__inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 14px 40px;
      max-width: var(--sh-container);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__count {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      background: var(--sh-gold);
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__label {
      flex: 1;
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sh-ivory);
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__deposit {
      font-family: var(--sh-serif);
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--sh-gold);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      background: var(--sh-gold);
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 200ms;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__cta:hover { background: var(--sh-ivory); }
    .sh-cart-bar__clear {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(247,244,239,.25);
      color: rgba(247,244,239,.6);
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: border-color 200ms, color 200ms;
    }
    .sh-cart-bar__clear:hover { border-color: var(--sh-ivory); color: var(--sh-ivory); }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .sh-cart-bar__inner { padding: 12px 20px; gap: 12px; }
      .sh-cart-bar__deposit { display: none; }
      .sh-cart-bar__label { font-size: 0.625rem; }
    }

    /* ── Editorial clinic gallery (Swiper background fade) ─ */
    .sh-editorial {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 560px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    /* Swiper fills the entire section background */
    .sh-edit-swiper {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    /* Fade: slides stack absolutely, opacity-driven */
    .sh-edit-swiper .swiper-wrapper { display: block; position: relative; height: 100%; }
    .sh-edit-swiper .swiper-slide {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 1.2s ease;
    }
    .sh-edit-swiper .swiper-slide-active { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
    .sh-edit-swiper .swiper-slide img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .sh-edit-swiper__placeholder { background: var(--sh-ink); }
    /* Zoom-to-lightbox icon, bottom-right of each slide */
    .sh-edit-swiper__zoom {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20px; right: 20px;
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
      color: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      z-index: 3;
      transition: background 200ms;
    }
    .sh-edit-swiper__zoom:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
    /* Pagination dots */
    .sh-edit-swiper__dots {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 3;
      display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;
    }
    .sh-edit-swiper__dots .swiper-pagination-bullet {
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.35);
      transition: background 200ms, transform 200ms;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .sh-edit-swiper__dots .swiper-pagination-bullet-active {
      background: #fff; transform: scale(1.4);
    }
    /* Gradient so text is always legible over the photos */
    .sh-editorial__overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(26,26,24,.72) 0%, rgba(26,26,24,.28) 58%, transparent 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .sh-editorial .sh-container { position: relative; z-index: 3; }

    /* ── Clinic lightbox ────────────────────────────────── */
    .sh-clinic-lb {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      z-index: 9990;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 250ms var(--sh-ease);
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb.is-open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
    .sh-clinic-lb__back {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.92);
      cursor: zoom-out;
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb__stage {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1200px;
      width: 90vw;
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb__img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 82vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      transition: opacity 180ms;
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: -48px; right: 0;
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      color: #fff; cursor: pointer;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      transition: background 200ms;
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb__close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
    .sh-clinic-lb__prev,
    .sh-clinic-lb__next {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      color: #fff; cursor: pointer;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      transition: background 200ms;
    }
    .sh-clinic-lb__prev { left: -64px; }
    .sh-clinic-lb__next { right: -64px; }
    .sh-clinic-lb__prev:hover,
    .sh-clinic-lb__next:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
    .sh-clinic-lb__counter {
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .sh-editorial { min-height: 420px; }
      .sh-clinic-lb__prev { left: 8px; }
      .sh-clinic-lb__next { right: 8px; }
      .sh-clinic-lb__stage { width: 100vw; }
    }

  </style>

  {{ 'global_core.scss.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {{ 'global_skinhealthy.scss.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {%- if template contains 'indexskinhealthy' -%}
    {{ 'page_skinhealthy_home.scss.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {%- endif -%}
  <style>
    /* ── DRAWER — load sau external CSS để win cascade ────── */
    .sh-drawer {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 950;
      background: var(--sh-ivory);
      transform: translateY(-100%);
      transition: transform 560ms var(--sh-ease);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    {%- if settings.skinhealthy_drawer_blur -%}
    .sh-drawer {
      background: rgba(247,244,239,0.97);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    }
    {%- endif -%}
    .sh-drawer.is-open { transform: translateY(0); }

    .sh-drawer__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 24px;
      right: 40px;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0;
      transition: color 200ms;
    }
    .sh-drawer__close:hover { color: var(--sh-gold); }

    .sh-drawer__inner {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 88px 40px 40px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .sh-drawer__search {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sh-line);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .sh-drawer__search-input {
      flex: 1;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: var(--fs-base);
      color: var(--sh-ink);
    }
    .sh-drawer__search-input::placeholder { color: var(--sh-ink-30); }
    .sh-drawer__search-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--sh-ink-60);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0;
      transition: color 200ms;
    }
    .sh-drawer__search-btn:hover { color: var(--sh-ink); }
    .sh-drawer__nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      width: 100%;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .sh-drawer__link {
      display: block;
      position: static;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: var(--fs-lg);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sh-line);
      transition: color 200ms var(--sh-ease);
    }
    .sh-drawer__link:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--sh-line); }
    .sh-drawer__link:hover { color: var(--sh-gold); }
    .sh-drawer__util {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--sh-line);
    }
    .sh-drawer__util-link {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--sh-sans);
      font-size: var(--fs-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.10em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sh-ink-60);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 200ms;
    }
    .sh-drawer__util-link:hover { color: var(--sh-ink); }

    /* ── LOGO — responsive, không méo ── */
    .sh-header__logo {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .sh-header__logo-img {
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      max-height: {{ settings.skinhealthy_logo_height_desktop | default: 56 }}px;
      height: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .sh-header__logo-text {
      font-family: var(--sh-serif);
      font-size: var(--fs-xl);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--sh-ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .sh-drawer__close { top: 20px; right: 20px; }
      .sh-drawer__inner { padding: 88px 24px 32px; }
      .sh-drawer__link  { font-size: var(--fs-base); padding: 12px 0; position: static; width: 100%; }
      .sh-header__logo-img {
        max-height: {{ settings.skinhealthy_logo_height_mobile | default: 36 }}px;
      }
    }
  </style>
  {{ 'jquery.js' | asset_url | script_tag }}
  {{ 'lazy.js'  | asset_url | script_tag }}
  {{ 'swiper.js' | asset_url | script_tag }}
{% include 'storefront_theme' %}
</head>
<body class="pc-clinic-v3 layout-skinhealthy{%- if settings.skinhealthy_announce != blank %} has-announce{%- endif %}">

{% assign topbar_context = 'clinic' %}{% include 'site_topbar' %}

{%- comment -%} ═══ HEADER ═══ {%- endcomment -%}
<header class="sh-header" id="sh-header">
  <div class="sh-header__bar sh-container">

    {%- comment -%} — Location icon — {%- endcomment -%}
    <a href="/he-thong-cua-hang" class="sh-header__location" aria-label="Vị trí cửa hàng">
      {%- if settings.skinhealthy_location_icon != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ settings.skinhealthy_location_icon | img_url: 'icon' }}"
             width="15" height="15" alt=""
             onerror="this.onerror=null;this.nextElementSibling.style.display='';this.style.display='none';">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:none">
          <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
      {%- else -%}
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if settings.store_address != blank -%}
        <span class="sh-header__location-text">{{ settings.store_address | truncate: 36, '…' }}</span>
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="sh-header__location-text">Tìm cửa hàng</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    {%- comment -%} — Logo center — {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%} sh_brand_name đã assign ở đầu <head> (dùng chung với <title>) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign sh_home_url = pages[settings.skinhealthy_home_page].url | default: '/' -%}
    <a href="{{ sh_home_url }}" class="sh-header__logo" title="{{ sh_brand_name }}">
      {%- if settings.skinhealthy_logo != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ settings.skinhealthy_logo | img_url: 'compact' }}"
             alt="{{ sh_brand_name }}"
             width="120" height="40"
             class="sh-header__logo-img"
             onerror="this.onerror=null;this.nextElementSibling.style.display='';this.remove();">
        <span class="sh-header__logo-text">{{ sh_brand_name }}</span>
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="sh-header__logo-text">{{ sh_brand_name }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    {%- comment -%} — Right: map btn + hamburger — {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sh-header__right">
      <a href="/he-thong-cua-hang" class="sh-header__map-btn" aria-label="Tìm cửa hàng gần bạn" title="Tìm cửa hàng gần bạn">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        <span class="sh-header__map-text">Tìm cửa hàng</span>
      </a>
      <button class="sh-header__hamburger" aria-label="Mở menu" id="sh-hamburger">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%} — Mobile drawer — {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="sh-drawer" id="sh-drawer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="sh-drawer__inner">
      <button class="sh-drawer__close" id="sh-drawer-close" aria-label="Đóng">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
      </button>
      <form action="/search" method="get" class="sh-drawer__search">
        <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
        <input type="text" name="query" class="sh-drawer__search-input" placeholder="Tìm kiếm sản phẩm..." aria-label="Tìm kiếm">
        <button type="submit" class="sh-drawer__search-btn" aria-label="Tìm">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
        </button>
      </form>
      <nav class="sh-drawer__nav">
        {%- assign sh_nav_ll = linklists[settings.skinhealthy_nav_menu] -%}
        {%- if settings.skinhealthy_nav_menu != blank and sh_nav_ll and sh_nav_ll.links.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for link in sh_nav_ll.links -%}
            <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="sh-drawer__link">{{ link.title }}</a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="/collections/all" class="sh-drawer__link">Sản Phẩm</a>
          <a href="{{ settings.skinhealthy_services_url | default: '/dich-vu-tri-lieu' }}" class="sh-drawer__link">Dịch Vụ</a>
          <a href="/dieu-tri-chuyen-nghiep" class="sh-drawer__link">Theo Nhu Cầu</a>
          <a href="/mua-sam-theo-thanh-phan" class="sh-drawer__link">Thành Phần</a>
          <a href="/tin-tuc" class="sh-drawer__link">Khoa Học</a>
          <a href="/lien-he" class="sh-drawer__link">Liên Hệ</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </nav>
      <div class="sh-drawer__util">
        {%- if customer -%}
          <a href="/account" class="sh-drawer__util-link">Tài khoản</a>
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="/account/login" class="sh-drawer__util-link">Đăng nhập</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        <a href="/cart" class="sh-drawer__util-link">Giỏ hàng{%- if cart.item_count > 0 %} ({{ cart.item_count }}){%- endif %}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sh-overlay" id="sh-overlay"></div>

</header>

{%- comment -%} ═══ MAIN CONTENT ═══ {%- endcomment -%}
<main class="sh-main" id="sh-main">
  {{ content_for_layout }}
</main>

{%- comment -%} ═══ FOOTER ═══ {%- endcomment -%}
<footer class="sh-footer">
  <div class="sh-footer__top sh-container">

    <div class="sh-footer__brand">
      <p class="sh-footer__brand-name">{{ settings.store_name | default: store.name }}</p>
      {%- if settings.store_address != blank -%}
        <p class="sh-footer__address">{{ settings.store_address }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if settings.store_phone != blank or store.phone_number != blank -%}
        <a href="tel:{{ settings.store_phone | default: store.phone_number | remove: ' ' }}" class="sh-footer__contact">
          {{ settings.store_phone | default: store.phone_number }}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="sh-footer__cols">
      {%- comment -%} col 1: Online services {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="sh-footer__col">
        <h3 class="sh-footer__col-title">{{ settings.skinhealthy_footer_online_title | default: 'Dịch Vụ Online' }}</h3>
        {%- assign sh_online_ll = linklists[settings.skinhealthy_footer_online_menu] -%}
        {%- if settings.skinhealthy_footer_online_menu != blank and sh_online_ll and sh_online_ll.links.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for link in sh_online_ll.links -%}
            <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="sh-footer__col-link">{{ link.title }}</a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="/account" class="sh-footer__col-link">Tài khoản của tôi</a>
          <a href="/lien-he" class="sh-footer__col-link">Liên hệ</a>
          <a href="/chinh-sach" class="sh-footer__col-link">Chính sách</a>
          <a href="/faq" class="sh-footer__col-link">FAQ</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} col 2: Về chúng tôi {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="sh-footer__col">
        <h3 class="sh-footer__col-title">Về Chúng Tôi</h3>
        {%- assign sh_footer_ll = linklists[settings.skinhealthy_footer_menu] -%}
        {%- if settings.skinhealthy_footer_menu != blank and sh_footer_ll and sh_footer_ll.links.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for link in sh_footer_ll.links -%}
            <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="sh-footer__col-link">{{ link.title }}</a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="/gioi-thieu" class="sh-footer__col-link">Giới thiệu</a>
          <a href="{{ settings.skinhealthy_services_url | default: '/dich-vu-tri-lieu' }}" class="sh-footer__col-link">Dịch vụ trị liệu</a>
          <a href="/phuong-phap" class="sh-footer__col-link">Phương pháp</a>
          <a href="/he-thong-cua-hang" class="sh-footer__col-link">Hệ thống cửa hàng</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        col 3: Social — REOPEN 2026-09-11, BUG THẬT phát hiện qua Playwright screenshot: cột
        này luôn rỗng vì settings.fot_social là BOOLEAN (true/false, dùng để BẬT/TẮT khối social
        ở theme chính — xem snippets/footer.bwt#footer_social_enable), KHÔNG PHẢI chuỗi URL để
        split(','). Đổi sang đúng các key settings.footer_social_* THẬT đã cấu hình sẵn (dùng
        chung với snippets/footer.bwt của theme chính, không tạo setting mới).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="sh-footer__col">
        <h3 class="sh-footer__col-title">Theo Dõi</h3>
        {%- if settings.footer_social_fb != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ settings.footer_social_fb }}" class="sh-footer__col-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.footer_social_insta != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ settings.footer_social_insta }}" class="sh-footer__col-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.footer_social_tiktok != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ settings.footer_social_tiktok }}" class="sh-footer__col-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.footer_social_whatsapp != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ settings.footer_social_whatsapp }}" class="sh-footer__col-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="sh-footer__bottom sh-container">
    {%- comment -%}
      REOPEN 2026-09-11 — BUG THẬT phát hiện qua Playwright screenshot: 'now' | date: '%Y' render
      ra "Invalid Date" (bộ lọc date trong dev-server.js/Sapo dùng new Date(v) — chuỗi literal
      "now" không phải cú pháp ngày hợp lệ trong JS Date, khác quy ước "now" đặc biệt của Shopify
      Liquid). Đổi sang quy ước ĐÃ HOẠT ĐỘNG THẬT ở snippets/footer.bwt (theme chính): copyright
      tĩnh có thể cấu hình qua settings, không phụ thuộc filter ngày động.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="sh-footer__copy">{{ settings.footer_copyright | default: '© Bản quyền thuộc về <b>Pharma Cosmetics</b>' }}. All rights reserved.</p>
    <div class="sh-footer__legal">
      <a href="/chinh-sach-bao-mat-thong-tin" class="sh-footer__legal-link">Chính sách bảo mật</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/dieu-khoan" class="sh-footer__legal-link">Điều khoản sử dụng</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function () {
  /* LazyLoad */
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    if (typeof LazyLoad !== 'undefined') {
      new LazyLoad({ elements_selector: '.lazyload', load_delay: 100, threshold: 0 });
    }
  });

  /* Header: transparent → solid on scroll; announce bar slides out */
  var hdr      = document.getElementById('sh-header');
  var announce = document.querySelector('.sh-announce');
  if (hdr) {
    window.addEventListener('scroll', function () {
      var scrolled = window.scrollY > 40;
      hdr.classList.toggle('sh-header--scrolled', scrolled);
      if (announce) { announce.classList.toggle('sh-announce--hidden', scrolled); }
    }, { passive: true });
  }

  /* Search toggle */
  var searchBar    = document.getElementById('sh-search');
  var searchToggle = document.getElementById('sh-search-toggle');
  var searchClose  = document.getElementById('sh-search-close');
  if (searchToggle && searchBar) {
    searchToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var open = searchBar.classList.toggle('is-open');
      searchBar.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!open));
      if (open) searchBar.querySelector('input').focus();
    });
    if (searchClose) {
      searchClose.addEventListener('click', function () {
        searchBar.classList.remove('is-open');
        searchBar.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      });
    }
  }

  /* Mobile drawer */
  var drawer    = document.getElementById('sh-drawer');
  var hamburger = document.getElementById('sh-hamburger');
  var drawerClose = document.getElementById('sh-drawer-close');
  var overlay   = document.getElementById('sh-overlay');
  function closeDrawer() {
    if (!drawer) return;
    drawer.classList.remove('is-open');
    drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
    document.body.style.overflow = '';
  }
  if (hamburger && drawer) {
    hamburger.addEventListener('click', function () {
      drawer.classList.toggle('is-open');
      drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!drawer.classList.contains('is-open')));
      document.body.style.overflow = drawer.classList.contains('is-open') ? 'hidden' : '';
    });
  }
  if (drawerClose) drawerClose.addEventListener('click', closeDrawer);
  if (overlay)     overlay.addEventListener('click', closeDrawer);
  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
    if (e.key === 'Escape' && drawer && drawer.classList.contains('is-open')) closeDrawer();
  });

  /* Scroll reveal */
  if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
      entries.forEach(function (e) {
        if (e.isIntersecting) {
          e.target.classList.add('is-visible');
          io.unobserve(e.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -48px 0px' });
    document.querySelectorAll('.sh-reveal').forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
  } else {
    document.querySelectorAll('.sh-reveal').forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('is-visible'); });
  }

  /* ── SHCart — global service basket ───────────────────────── */
  {%- comment -%}
    skinhealthy_booking_page (setting "Trang đặt lịch / MOPS") tồn tại trong schema
    từ trước nhưng chưa nơi nào đọc — trỏ cứng "dat-lich-tu-van" (trang cũ, không
    còn dùng trong luồng MOPS hiện tại). Ưu tiên setting nếu owner đã chọn trang thật.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign sh_book_page = pages[settings.skinhealthy_booking_page] -%}
  window.SHCart = (function () {
    var KEY       = 'sh_svc_cart';
    var BOOK_BASE = '{{ sh_book_page.url | default: pages["dat-lich-tu-van"].url | default: "/dat-lich-tu-van" }}';
    var bar, countEl, depositEl, ctaEl;

    function load() {
      try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || '[]'); } catch (e) { return []; }
    }

    function save(items) {
      try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(items)); } catch (e) {}
      render(items);
      document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('shCartChange', { detail: { items: items } }));
    }

    function has(svc_id) {
      return load().some(function (i) { return i.svc_id === svc_id; });
    }

    function add(svc) {
      var items = load();
      if (!items.some(function (i) { return i.svc_id === svc.svc_id; })) {
        items.push(svc);
        save(items);
      }
    }

    function remove(svc_id) {
      save(load().filter(function (i) { return i.svc_id !== svc_id; }));
    }

    function clear() { save([]); }

    function render(items) {
      items = items || load();
      bar       = bar       || document.getElementById('sh-cart-bar');
      if (!bar) return;

      if (!items.length) { bar.classList.remove('is-open'); return; }
      bar.classList.add('is-open');

      countEl   = countEl   || bar.querySelector('.sh-cart-bar__count');
      depositEl = depositEl || bar.querySelector('.sh-cart-bar__deposit');
      ctaEl     = ctaEl     || bar.querySelector('.sh-cart-bar__cta');

      if (countEl) { countEl.textContent = items.length; }

      var total = items.reduce(function (s, i) { return s + (Number(i.deposit) || 0); }, 0);
      if (depositEl) {
        depositEl.textContent = total > 0
          ? 'Cọc ' + total.toLocaleString('vi-VN') + ' ₫'
          : 'Miễn phí';
      }

      if (ctaEl) {
        var params = items.map(function (i) {
          return 'svc=' + encodeURIComponent(i.svc_id);
        }).join('&');
        ctaEl.href = BOOK_BASE + '?' + params;
      }
    }

    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
      render();
      var clearBtn = document.getElementById('sh-cart-clear');
      if (clearBtn) { clearBtn.addEventListener('click', function () { clear(); }); }
    });

    return { add: add, remove: remove, clear: clear, has: has, load: load, render: render };
  }());
})();
</script>


<div class="sh-cart-bar" id="sh-cart-bar" role="complementary" aria-label="Dịch vụ đã chọn">
  <div class="sh-cart-bar__inner">
    <span class="sh-cart-bar__count" aria-live="polite">0</span>
    <span class="sh-cart-bar__label">dịch vụ đã chọn</span>
    <span class="sh-cart-bar__deposit"></span>
    <a href="/dat-lich-tu-van" class="sh-cart-bar__cta">
      Đặt lịch ngay
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
    </a>
    <button type="button" class="sh-cart-bar__clear" id="sh-cart-clear" aria-label="Xóa tất cả dịch vụ đã chọn">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
